description 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/1".

description 1 is a legal rule.

description 1 has the label "Vessel position data (Article 12, Chapter IV and Appendix 4 of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_4/art_12".

description 1 produces item 1 action.

description 1 has the description "The vessel must be equipped with a vessel monitoring device and provide information identifying the vessel, its position, course and speed at regular intervals (VMS data).".


description 2 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/2".

description 2 is a legal rule.

description 2 has the label "Electronic fishing logbooks (Chapter IV and Appendix 4 of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 2 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_4".

description 2 produces item 2 action.

description 2 has the description "The master must record catch data on a daily basis in an electronic fishing logbook integrated into an electronic recording and reporting system (ERS).".


description 3 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/3".

description 3 is a legal rule.

description 3 has the label "Requests for authorisation of vessels (Chapter I of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 3 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_1".

description 3 produces item 3 action.

description 3 has the description "A database of authorisations is used to apply for the fishing authorisation from the partner country".


description 4 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/4".

description 4 is a legal rule.

description 4 has the label "Daily data transmission (Chapter IV and Appendix 4 of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 4 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_4".

description 4 produces item 4 action.

description 4 has the description "Electronic logbook data shall be transmitted automatically and on a daily basis to the Fisheries Monitoring Centre (FMC) of the flag State.".


description 5 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/5".

description 5 is a legal rule.

description 5 has the label "Entries into and exits from the fishing zone, prior notifications and landing and transhipment declarations (Chapter IV, and Appendix 4 of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 5 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_4".

description 5 produces item 5 action.

description 5 has the description "Recording and transmission of each entry into and exit from the fishing zone via the ERS or other electronic means of communication.".


description 6 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/6".

description 6 is a legal rule.

description 6 has the label "Quarterly aggregated data (Chapter III of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 6 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/chp_3".

description 6 produces item 6 action.

description 6 has the description "The flag State shall provide the European Commission with the aggregated quantities of catches and discards on a quarterly basis.".


description 7 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/7".

description 7 is a legal rule.

description 7 has the label "Data protection (Article 11 and Appendix 7 of the Annex to the Protocol)".

description 7 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/193/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_193/FINAL/eng/art_11".

description 7 has the description "Data on fishing activities shall be treated in a confidential and secure manner.".


